	| Priority      | Normal                                             |
	| Product       | Liferay Portal > 6.2                               |
	| Sub-Status    | —                                                  |
	| Component     | Activation Key & Project Administration            |
	| System Status | Production > Functioning with limited capabilities |
	| Attachments   | Document_1.txt                                     |
	And I upload a file using the large file uploader with the following parameters
	| Attachment       | Document_2.txt      |
